  "notes": "USAGE:\nThe derived adjective {圧倒的|あっとうてき} (overwhelming) is extremely common and often more frequent than the base form. The passive form {圧倒|あっとう}される (to be overwhelmed) is also very common.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {圧倒的|あっとうてき}: overwhelming (adjectival form)\n- {圧倒的|あっとうてき}な{多数|たすう}: overwhelming majority\n- ～に{圧倒|あっとう}される: to be overwhelmed by ~\n- {圧倒的|あっとうてき}な{勝利|しょうり}: overwhelming victory",
